            "review_title": "Review at Miyoshi Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "T Nguyen\nSan Francisco, California20 contributions\n1\nGreat authentic Japanese cuisine!\nMar 2024 • Family\nI had lunch with my cousins today who are locals of Da Nang and we had a great experience. The food is authentic (the owner is a Japanese chef from Japan), the service is good, and the atmosphere is relaxing. I’ve enjoyed Japanese cuisine all over the world and at different levels and this restaurant is excellent for a moderate budget. I visit my family in Da Nang every year and I will definitely return here each time I’m in town. Go there and you won’t regret it.\nRead more\nWritten March 11, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
