            "review_title": "Review at Miyoshi Japanese Restaurant",
            "review_text": "無名\nWorld9941 contributions\n1\nSolid\nDec 2019 • Family\nYes, very tasty Japanese food here. I have no complaints with it, and I believe the price was reasonable as well. The place is Japanese owned and managed, and I enjoyed chatting with them and other some customers tonight. They comped us a small appetizer, squid (cuttlefish?) sembei (a Japanese cracker of sorts) they produce locally here in Vietnam. It was really good and fresh, so we ordered some more. My nephew and I shared an assortment of dishes. We had a tempura variety plate, chicken yakitori, and a spicy ramen. All this for only ₫420000. Like I said everything was very tasty - a super solid meal.\nRead more\nWritten December 23, 2019",
